source: tools/junius/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout
---
Scaffold new plugins, components, RPC services, migrations, permissions. (Source-tree-only — gated behind the `develop` feature.)

Usage: junius new [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  plugin      Scaffold a new plugin under `plugins/<NAME>/`. Pure scaffolding — does not require or touch a deployment `platform.toml`; run `junius sync --config <deployment>` afterward to wire it in
  component   Add a new component to a plugin's frontend lib. (Stub — lands in M07.)
  rpc         Add a new RPC service to a plugin's proto. (Stub — lands in M05.)
  migration   Create a new migration under `plugins/<PLUGIN>/migrations/`. (Stub — lands in M06.)
  permission  Add a permission entry to a plugin's manifest. (Stub — lands in M07.)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format for command results [default: plain] [possible values: plain, json]
  -v, --verbose...       Increase verbosity (repeat for more)
      --cwd <CWD>        Run as if junius were started in <CWD>
  -h, --help             Print help
